rows.sourceExcerpt:
    Causes the calling thread to sleep for `msec` milliseconds.

    .. versionadded:: 1.34.0

.. code-block:: c
    #include <uv.h>
    #include <stdio.h>
    int main() {
        printf("Sleeping for 1 second...\n");
        uv_sleep(1000);
        printf("Awake!\n");
        return 0;
    }

